@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@email = swift-test@example.com
@password = 1234

### Registrar cuenta de práctica · 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login con la cuenta de práctica · 200
# @name accountLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Eliminar la cuenta de práctica y sus sesiones · 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accountLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Comprobar que la sesión quedó invalidada · 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accountLogin.response.body.$.token}}
